of annual operating expense reductions that we talked about last quarter and which is part of our three-year $245 million cost reduction goal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/24/avnet-avt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AVT 2020 Q2","e":"avt","d":"2020-01-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Amelio","x":"Some of the cost savings that Tom will outline include the further integration of back-office functions between electronic components and the Farnell business units.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/24/avnet-avt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AVT 2020 Q3","e":"avt","d":"2020-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Liguori","x":"On our opex, we continue to work with the 245 million cost-reduction plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/avnet-avt-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AVT 2021 Q3","e":"avt","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Phil Gallagher","x":"On top of that, many suppliers are also experiencing raw material price increases for items such as resins, coppers and more.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/avnet-inc-avt-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2021 Q3","e":"avt","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Phil Gallagher","x":"Avnet that is in most cases able to pass along these price increases to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/avnet-inc-avt-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2021 Q3","e":"avt","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Liguori","x":"As Phil mentioned, the decision to continue to operate both warehouses was primarily driven by strong demand and a decision to prioritize customer service over cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/avnet-inc-avt-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2021 Q4","e":"avt","d":"2021-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Phil Gallagher","x":"So we definitely, as we noted in the script, we are definitely seeing price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/11/avnet-inc-avt-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2022 Q1","e":"avt","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Phil Gallagher","x":"I mean as we get cost increases from the suppliers, which has been, by the way, over 50-plus suppliers, and there's been multiple iterations of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/avnet-inc-avt-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2022 Q1","e":"avt","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Phil Gallagher","x":"And we work to pass those on to the customers as quickly as we can.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/avnet-inc-avt-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2022 Q1","e":"avt","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Ruplu Bhattacharya","x":"Can you give us an update on your restructuring efforts?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/avnet-inc-avt-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2022 Q1","e":"avt","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Ruplu Bhattacharya","x":"And is there any more opportunity to have more operational efficiencies, take more cost out?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/avnet-inc-avt-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q1","e":"avt","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip R. Gallagher","x":"That said, we do see extended lead times and price increases in memory storage and certain interconnect products particularly those supporting data center and AI build-outs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/avnet-avt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q1","e":"avt","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip R. Gallagher","x":"Consistent with our views, our supplier partners are also seeing several positive signs including lead times extending in certain technology and discussions on actual or potential price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/avnet-avt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q1","e":"avt","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kenneth A. Jacobson","x":"In the prepared remarks, you talked about you know, suppliers seeing potential for price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/avnet-avt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q2","e":"avt","d":"2026-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kenneth A. Jacobson","x":"But the actual quarterly results did not have a lot of impact from actual price increases in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/avnet-avt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q2","e":"avt","d":"2026-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ruplu Bhattacharya","x":"Can you remind us how like, if suppliers are raising prices, how does that impact Avnet's revenues and margins in the near term as well as in the more medium term?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/avnet-avt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q3","e":"avt","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"As data center and AI demand proliferates throughout the market, we also saw broad-based demand across most of our core end markets. which translated into meaningful operating margin and EPS improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/avnet-avt-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q3","e":"avt","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"While lead time extensions continue in components supporting data center and AI builds, they are now spreading the broader set of products supporting diverse end market applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/avnet-avt-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q3","e":"avt","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"In the December quarter, we saw early indicators of certain component price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/avnet-avt-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q3","e":"avt","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"During the March quarter, we have seen price increases across a few suppliers and technologies, most predominantly related to memory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/avnet-avt-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q4","e":"avt","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"What initially appeared to be demand concentrated around AI and data center-related deployments has broadened considerably with extended lead times now evident across a wider range of applications and end markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/avnet-avt-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q4","e":"avt","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"While we benefit from sales into data center applications and technologies that support AI infrastructure, we are also seeing positive effects across our diversified end markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/avnet-avt-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q4","e":"avt","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"We expect additional price increases from a number of semiconductor and IP&E suppliers in the months ahead.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/avnet-avt-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2026 Q4","e":"avt","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"Well, as a general statement, even outside of memory, we're starting to see a broader expansion of price increases across other commodities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/avnet-avt-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2027 Q1","e":"avt","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"As investment in AI infrastructure increases, it drives demand for more business processors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/avnet-avt-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AVT 2027 Q1","e":"avt","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip Gallagher","x":"While we are seeing accelerated growth in the data center market and are experiencing the ripple effects of that growth in our business, the opportunity for Avnet extends well beyond direct AI-related data center sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/avnet-avt-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,5565,0,0,0,4586,650],[36,1,8053,0,0,0,5859,1749],[37,1,6794,0,0,0,5195,1238],[38,1,6525,0,0,0,5393,721],[40,1,8183,0,0,0,6023,1757],[41,1,9221,0,0,0,7260,1527],[45,1,8849,0,0,0,7151,1325],[46,1,6119,0,0,0,4645,1146],[47,1,6803,0,0,0,5313,1173],[63,1,5077,0,0,0,4824,0],[64,1,3216,0,0,0,2664,277],[65,1,6258,0,0,0,5164,897],[66,1,7180,0,0,0,5757,1205],[67,1,6229,0,0,0,5077,952]],"cinema":[[35,1,5565,0,0,0,4586,650],[36,1,8053,0,0,0,5859,1749],[37,1,6794,0,0,0,5195,1238],[38,1,6525,0,0,0,5393,721],[40,1,8183,0,0,0,6023,1757],[41,1,9221,0,0,0,7260,1527],[45,1,8849,0,0,0,7151,1325],[46,1,6119,0,0,0,4645,1146],[47,1,6803,0,0,0,5313,1173],[63,1,5077,0,0,0,4824,0],[64,1,3216,0,0,0,2664,277],[65,1,6258,0,0,0,5164,897],[66,1,7180,0,0,0,5757,1205],[67,1,6229,0,0,0,5077,952]],"imax":[[35,1,